{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>《Patterns》是一款讓使用者自行生成手機與電腦桌布的圖案創作工具，內置 40 種生成風格，適合喜歡獨特視覺效果、不想使用現成圖片的人。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，所有圖案均於裝置上以完整解析度渲染，無需連線即可使用。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-169.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>離線生成專屬桌布</h2>\n<p>內置 40 種生成風格，分為漸變、紋理、幾何與粒子四大類，可透過比例、密度、複雜度、對稱、旋轉、深度、光暈與模糊等滑桿即時調整，亦可改用自訂色盤或隨機種子。支援 HD、QHD 及 4K 輸出，適用於 iPhone、iPad 與 Mac，並可收藏作品、保留歷史記錄、匯出 PNG 或經分享選單傳送。</p>\n<figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-155-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-156-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-157-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-158-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-159-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-160-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure>\n</figure>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Patterns: Create Wallpapers</li>\n<li>應用類別：Lifestyle</li>\n<li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/patterns-create-wallpapers/id6801606517?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li>\n</ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T00:04:23.240031+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":340,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T23:43:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T04:12:59.252220+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T23:57:51.310979+00:00","content_hash":"e904da395d0f850f76c1972e9d838ffa86c7eef4a659da0298e64677831f7811","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}